---
title: Conversations
description: Informal conversations with the people working behind the scenes of revenue operations, data, and technology. Exploring their experiences, challenges, and the ideas shaping how we work.
layout: 'base.njk'
---

<main id="main" class="container">
  <header class="py-5">
    <h1>Conversations</h1>
    <p class="fs-4">{{ description }}</p>
  </header>
  {%- if collections.conversations.length %}
  <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 py-3 g-4">
    {%- for ep in collections.conversations %}
    {% include "episode-card.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  {%- else %}
  <p class="fs-4 emptyState">{% icon "conversations" %} No conversations published yet.</p>
  {%- endif %}
</main>
